</pre></td><td class='code'><pre><code class=''><span class='line'>HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE
</span><span class='line'>
</span><span class='line'>SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall</span></code></pre></td></tr></table></div></figure>


<h4>注册表 usb设备列表</h4>

<figure class='code'><div class="highlight"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre class="line-numbers"><span class='line-number'>1</span>
<span class='line-number'>2</span>
<span class='line-number'>3</span>
<span class='line-number'>4</span>
<span class='line-number'>5</span>
</pre></td><td class='code'><pre><code class=''><span class='line'>在注册表里查看USB设备列表，主要看这几个路径：
</span><span class='line'>
