  <entry>
    <title type="html"><![CDATA[Python获取运行目录的5种方法及实现]]></title>
    <link href="http://abcdxyzk.github.io/blog/2026/11/07/lang-python-dir/"/>
    <updated>2026-11-07T17:48:00+08:00</updated>
    <id>http://abcdxyzk.github.io/blog/2026/11/07/lang-python-dir</id>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://comate.baidu.com/zh/page/a6emajt9jkp">https://comate.baidu.com/zh/page/a6emajt9jkp</a></p>

<p>方法对比与实现</p>

<h4>使用os.getcwd()获取当前工作目录</h4>

<figure class='code'><div class="highlight"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre class="line-numbers"><span class='line-number'>1</span>
<span class='line-number'>2</span>
<span class='line-number'>3</span>
<span class='line-number'>4</span>
<span class='line-number'>5</span>
</pre></td><td class='code'><pre><code class=''><span class='line'>import os
</span><span class='line'>
</span><span class='line'># 获取当前工作目录
</span><span class='line'>current_dir = os.getcwd()
</span><span class='line'>print("当前工作目录:", current_dir)</span></code></pre></td></tr></table></div></figure>


<p>说明：返回进程启动时的工作目录，可能与脚本所在目录不同。</p>

<h4>使用os.path.abspath(<code>__file__</code>)获取脚本绝对路径</h4>

<figure class='code'><div class="highlight"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre class="line-numbers"><span class='line-number'>1</span>
<span class='line-number'>2</span>
<span class='line-number'>3</span>
<span class='line-number'>4</span>
<span class='line-number'>5</span>
</pre></td><td class='code'><pre><code class=''><span class='line'>import os
</span><span class='line'>
</span><span class='line'># 获取当前脚本的绝对路径
</span><span class='line'>script_path = os.path.abspath(__file__)
</span><span class='line'>print("脚本绝对路径:", script_path)</span></code></pre></td></tr></table></div></figure>


<p>说明：<code>__file__</code>是当前脚本的文件名，交互式环境中不可用。</p>

<h4>使用os.path.dirname获取脚本所在目录</h4>

<figure class='code'><div class="highlight"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre class="line-numbers"><span class='line-number'>1</span>
<span class='line-number'>2</span>
<span class='line-number'>3</span>
<span class='line-number'>4</span>
<span class='line-number'>5</span>
</pre></td><td class='code'><pre><code class=''><span class='line'>import os
</span><span class='line'>
</span><span class='line'># 获取脚本所在目录
</span><span class='line'>script_dir = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))
</span><span class='line'>print("脚本所在目录:", script_dir)</span></code></pre></td></tr></table></div></figure>


<p>说明：常用于定位脚本同级目录下的资源文件。</p>

<h4>使用pathlib.Path.cwd()获取工作目录（推荐）</h4>

<figure class='code'><div class="highlight"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre class="line-numbers"><span class='line-number'>1</span>
<span class='line-number'>2</span>
<span class='line-number'>3</span>
<span class='line-number'>4</span>
<span class='line-number'>5</span>
</pre></td><td class='code'><pre><code class=''><span class='line'>from pathlib import Path
</span><span class='line'>
</span><span class='line'># 获取当前工作目录（Path对象）
</span><span class='line'>path_dir = Path.cwd()
</span><span class='line'>print("工作目录(Path):", path_dir)</span></code></pre></td></tr></table></div></figure>


<p>说明：面向对象的方式，更符合现代Python编程风格。</p>

<h4>使用pathlib.Path(<code>__file__</code>)获取脚本路径</h4>

<figure class='code'><div class="highlight"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre class="line-numbers"><span class='line-number'>1</span>
<span class='line-number'>2</span>
<span class='line-number'>3</span>
<span class='line-number'>4</span>
<span class='line-number'>5</span>
<span class='line-number'>6</span>
</pre></td><td class='code'><pre><code class=''><span class='line'>from pathlib import Path
</span><span class='line'>
</span><span class='line'># 获取脚本路径和父目录
</span><span class='line'>current_file = Path(__file__).resolve()
</span><span class='line'>print("脚本绝对路径:", current_file)
</span><span class='line'>print("脚本父目录:", current_file.parent)</span></code></pre></td></tr></table></div></figure>


<p>说明：resolve()可解析符号链接，parent属性直接获取父目录。</p>

<h4>方法对比表</h4>

<figure class='code'><div class="highlight"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre class="line-numbers"><span class='line-number'>1</span>
<span class='line-number'>2</span>
<span class='line-number'>3</span>
<span class='line-number'>4</span>
<span class='line-number'>5</span>
<span class='line-number'>6</span>
<span class='line-number'>7</span>
</pre></td><td class='code'><pre><code class=''><span class='line'>方法   适用场景    返回值类型 备注
</span><span class='line'>
</span><span class='line'>os.getcwd()   获取工作目录  字符串   交互式环境可用
</span><span class='line'>os.path.abspath(__file__) 获取脚本路径  字符串   脚本专用
</span><span class='line'>os.path.dirname() 获取父目录 字符串   需配合abspath
</span><span class='line'>Path.cwd()    获取工作目录  Path对象  推荐现代用法
</span><span class='line'>Path(__file__).resolve()  获取脚本路径  Path对象  支持符号链接解析</span></code></pre></td></tr></table></div></figure>



]]></content>
  </entry>
  
</feed>
